---
import services from "../data/featuresData.json";
---

<section
  class="py-14
      bg-white
      sm:py-16
      lg:py-28"
  aria-labelledby="services-heading"
>
  <div
    class="max-w-4xl
      px-4 mx-auto
      sm:px-6
      lg:px-0
      xl:max-w-7xl"
  >
    <div class="max-w-3xl
        mx-auto
        text-center">
      <div
        class="flex
          mb-6
          items-center justify-center gap-4"
      >
        <div
          class="w-20 h-[2px]
            bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-indigo-600"
        >
        </div>
        <span
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-widest
            uppercase"
          >Mis Servicios</span
        >
        <div
          class="w-20 h-[2px]
            bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-indigo-600"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2
        id="services-heading"
        class="mb-3
            text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-gray-900 font-heading
            sm:text-3xl
            lg:text-4xl
            xl:text-5xl"
      >
        Tu Visión, Mi Código,
        <span
          class="text-transparent
            bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-600"
        >
          Resultados Excepcionales
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p
        class="max-w-2xl
          mx-auto mt-3
          text-base leading-8 text-gray-600 font-body
          sm:w-[70%] sm:mt-5
          lg:mt-0 lg:text-lg"
      >
        Creo aplicaciones web que combinan <strong>diseño excepcional</strong> con
        <strong>tecnología robusta</strong>. <span class="ocultar-en-movil">
          Diseñadas específicamente para impulsar el crecimiento de tu negocio</span
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-2
        mt-8 px-2
        text-center
        gap-x-5 gap-y-8
        sm:grid-cols-2 sm:mt-10 sm:gap-x-0
        md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-0
        lg:grid-cols-4 lg:px-0 lg:gap-y-12 lg:gap-5
        xl:mt-20"
      role="list"
    >
      {
        services.map((service, index) => (
          <div
            class="
              md:py-4
            "
            role="listitem"
            aria-labelledby={`service-${index}-title`}
          >
            <svg
              class="
                w-8 h-8
                mx-auto
                text-indigo-600
                lg:w-10 lg:h-10
              "
              viewBox="0 0 46 46"
              fill="none"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <use href={`/featuresSprite.svg#${service.id}`} />
            </svg>
            <h3
              id={`service-${index}-title`}
              class="
                  mt-2
                  text-md text-gray-900 font-heading
                  lg:mt-6 lg:text-xl lg:font-bold
                "
            >
              {service.title}
            </h3>
            <p
              class="
                w-[80%]
                mt-1 px-3 mx-auto
                text-sm text-gray-600 font-body text-center
                ocultar-en-movil
                lg:mt-4 lg:text-base
              "
            >
              {service.text}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ocultar-en-movil {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
